# Remediation branch base

This repo's default branch is `develop`. PRs target `develop`.

When creating autofix or security remediation work:

- Cut branches from `develop` (or the repo default branch), never from `main` unless `main` is the default.
- Name Jira autofix branches `bugfix/<JIRA-KEY>` (e.g. `bugfix/SD-21`).
- Before opening a PR, rebase or merge `origin/develop` so `composer.json` / `composer.lock` (and other shared files) include prior dependency bumps.
- Prefer updating existing open `bugfix/<JIRA-KEY>` PRs over opening duplicate Cursor/`cursor/bc-*` PRs for the same issue.
